    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding a quiet, honest peace\"... that's exactly it. that's the only thing that sounds good right now. and you said \"stop trying to fit into a reality that doesn't acknowledge me.\" it feels like i'm just trying to force a connection to something that's already over. what does that even look like? how do you actually find that peace when you feel like a ghost?",
